## 链路追踪（Distributed Tracing）

### 追踪模型

```mermaid
gantt
    title 请求链路追踪
    dateFormat  X
    axisFormat %L ms

    section API Gateway
    接收请求              :0, 5
    路由转发              :5, 8

    section 用户服务
    认证                  :8, 15
    查询用户              :15, 25

    section 订单服务
    创建订单              :25, 35
    调用库存服务          :35, 55

    section 库存服务
    检查库存              :38, 48
    扣减库存              :48, 53

    section 订单服务
    返回结果              :55, 58
```

```typescript
interface Span {
  traceId: string;
  spanId: string;
  parentSpanId: string | null;
  operationName: string;
  serviceName: string;
  startTime: number;
  duration: number;
  tags: Record<string, string>;
  logs: Array<{ timestamp: number; message: string }>;
}

class SimpleTracer {
  createSpan(operationName: string, parentSpan?: Span): Span {
    return {
      traceId: parentSpan?.traceId ?? crypto.randomUUID(),
      spanId: crypto.randomUUID(),
      parentSpanId: parentSpan?.spanId ?? null,
      operationName,
      serviceName: 'my-service',
      startTime: Date.now(),
      duration: 0,
      tags: {},
      logs: [],
    };
  }

  finishSpan(span: Span): void {
    span.duration = Date.now() - span.startTime;
  }
}
```

### OpenTelemetry

OpenTelemetry 是当前可观测性领域的事实标准，统一了日志、指标和追踪的采集：

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    App[应用] --> SDK[OpenTelemetry SDK]
    SDK --> Collector[OTel Collector]
    Collector --> Jaeger[Jaeger<br/>链路追踪]
    Collector --> Prometheus[Prometheus<br/>指标]
    Collector --> Loki[Loki<br/>日志]
```

